---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Sci Art Club"
    description="Sci Art Club: a community for people who make art about science, and science that looks like art."
>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
                <span class="font-majormono font-normal">sci ARt club</span>
            </h1>
            <!-- Haeckel logo loop -->
            <div class="mb-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                <img
                    src="/images/haeckel-logo-loop.gif"
                    alt="The sci ARt club logo over a cycling series of Ernst Haeckel plates: jellyfish, siphonophores, pitcher plants, radiolarians, comb jellies, brittle stars, and bats"
                    width="1600"
                    height="900"
                    class="w-full h-auto rounded-md"
                />
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mt-3 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    Plates by <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernst_Haeckel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Ernst Haeckel</a>, from <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kunstformen_der_Natur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"><em>Kunstformen der Natur</em></a> (Art Forms in Nature, 1899 to 1904). Public domain; images via <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Kunstformen_der_Natur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Wikimedia Commons</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Come draw, research, write, and make something about the world with us.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- About Section -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                No expertise needed, just curiosity. Bring a question, a sketchbook,
                or scraps of science that intrigue you. You'll be in good company
                whether you're inspired by Robert Hooke or Ernst Haeckel, Santiago
                Ramón y Cajal or Rachel Carson, Leonardo da Vinci or W.E.B. Du Bois.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                What to expect:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span>Hands-on creative workshops</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span>Show-and-tells</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span>Skill swaps</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span>Science fairs</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                Let's make some sci-art together! 🔬🎨
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Join -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <a
                href="https://www.meetup.com/sci-art-club/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors"
                >Join us on Meetup</a
            >
            <a
                href="https://www.instagram.com/sci_art_club/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-block border border-blue-600 text-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-50 font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors ml-2 mt-2 sm:mt-0"
                >Follow @sci_art_club on Instagram</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
